        "detailed_description": "<h1>Free old version on itch.io</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Available at: alexander-badrak itch.io mad-world-survivors</u></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117370/extras/05668f860642cb8022abc412b74032da.avif?t=1780692366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117370/extras_big/05668f860642cb8022abc412b74032da.avif?t=1780692366 width=800 height=246 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad World Survivors is a fast-paced rogue-lite shooter where you battle relentless hordes of monsters in a world consumed by chaos. Players must survive intense combat where every decision could be their last. If you enjoy quick action, unique character abilities, and ever-changing battle conditions, this game is for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-stop action with countless enemies and powerful abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated runs: every attempt is unique, adding endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system: choose your hero and upgrade abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affordable price and regular updates crafted with community care.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad World Survivors is a fast-paced rogue-lite shooter where you battle relentless hordes of monsters in a world consumed by chaos. Players must survive intense combat where every decision could be their last. If you enjoy quick action, unique character abilities, and ever-changing battle conditions, this game is for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-stop action with countless enemies and powerful abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated runs: every attempt is unique, adding endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system: choose your hero and upgrade abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affordable price and regular updates crafted with community care.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Mad World Survivors is a fast-paced rogue-lite shooter where you battle relentless hordes of monsters in a world consumed by chaos. Players must survive intense combat where every decision could be their last",
